     "extraction_status": "extracted",
     "value": "aligned to correct for head movement; slice timing correction using sine interpolation; normalized to Montreal Neurological Institute coordinates; resampled at 3 \u00d7 3 x 3 mm3 resolution; Gaussian smoothing with a 4 mm full-width at half-maximum kernel; time series scaled to a mean signal value of 100",
